 34S  c  1985We07: {+37}Cl(p,|a|g){+34}S with E{-p}=0.65-2.15 MeV from the      
 34S 2c  University of Melbourne 5U Pelletron accelerator. The targets were     
 34S 3c  BaCl2, 98.2% enriched in {+37}Cl, on gold and aluminum backings. |g    
 34S 4c  rays were detected by a Ge(Li) detector and neutrons were detected by  
 34S 5c  two BF3 proportional counters. Measured E|g, I|g, |g yields for        
 34S 6c  {+37}Cl(p,|g){+38}Ar and {+37}Cl(p,|a|g){+34}S reactions, and neutron  
 34S 7c  yields for the {+37}Cl(p,n){+37}Ar reaction. Deduced cross sections and
 34S 8c  thermonuclear reaction rates.                                          
 34S  c  1985Ki07: {+37}Cl(p,|a|g){+34}S with E{-p}=2.4-4.2 MeV from the the 5  
 34S 2c  MV Van de Graaff accelerator of the Institute of Nuclear Research,     
 34S 3c  Hungary. |g rays were detected using a 25-cm3 Ge(Li) detector. Measured
 34S 4c  |g-ray yields for {+37}Cl(p,|a|g){+34}S and {+34}S(p,p'|g){+34}S       
 34S 5c  reactions, which are part of a series of proton-induced prompt |g-ray  
 34S 6c  emission (PIGE) measurements.                                          
 34S  c  1975De16: {+37}Cl(p,|a|g){+34}S with E{-p}=1-3 MeV.                    
 34S  c  1974Al05: {+37}Cl(p,|a{-0}){+34}S with E{-p}=1.17-1.70 MeV from Utrecht
 34S 2c  3-MV Van de Graaff accelerator. Measured yields.                       
 34S  c  1970An22: {+37}Cl(p,|a{-0}){+34}S, {+37}Cl(p,|a{-1}){+34}S with        
 34S 2c  E{-p}=5.84, 5.93, and 6.03 MeV. Measured |s(E{-|a},|q). Deduced 38Ar   
 34S 3c  level widths and densities.                                            
 34S  c  1966VO03: {+37}Cl(p,|a{-0}){+34}S, {+37}Cl(p,|a{-1}){+34}S, and        
 34S 2c  {+37}Cl(p,|a{-2}){+34}S with E{-p}=11.0-11.952 MeV from the Heidelberg 
 34S 3c  Tandem Van de Graaff accelerator. Measured |s(E{-p},E{-|a},|q). Deduced
